Error [E0357]: State `open` must be PascalCase
  --> tests/ui/typestate/state_section_shape_diagnostics_are_distinct_4.jet:1:23
    |
  1 | struct Door { state { open } open: Bool }
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: Jet enforces PascalCase for type-like names, snake_case for value-like names, and ALL_CAPS (SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE) for module-global constants (D-SHAPE-CASE1)
 Fix: Rename it to `Open`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0357

Error [E0167]: State `open` collides with a member of `Door`
  --> tests/ui/typestate/state_section_shape_diagnostics_are_distinct_4.jet:1:23
    |
  1 | struct Door { state { open } open: Bool }
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: State facts and ordinary members share the owning type's namespace
 Fix: Rename the state or the member so `Type.State.open` is unique
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0167
